# DsSlider docs snippets

## Default

### Show code
<DsSlider
  defaultValue={36}
  label="Input label"
  max={100}
  min={0}
  type="value"
/>

### MCP manifest
const Default = () => <DsSlider label="Input label" type="value" defaultValue={36} min={0} max={100} />;

## Range

### Show code
<DsSlider
  defaultValue={[
    36,
    60
  ]}
  label="Input label"
  max={100}
  min={0}
  thumbLabels={[
    'Minimum',
    'Maximum'
  ]}
  type="range"
/>

### MCP manifest
const Range = () => <DsSlider
    label="Input label"
    type="range"
    defaultValue={[36, 60]}
    min={0}
    max={100}
    thumbLabels={['Minimum', 'Maximum']} />;

## Small

### Show code
<DsSlider
